ou can have that. If you dont want to invite me to a group, also your choice and you can do that, and I have no complaints.<br /><br />However, flaming IL for having freinds help on an encounter..is a closer example of gossip then what I said about hayward/sarrax, I mean come on, you couldnt come up with a flame for me, so you go for the guild! Just take a few extra minutes and come up with something to roast me with, if you can even think of something at all.<br /><br />On that, I never claimed IL did RZ by ourselves, I just wanted to know how having friends help means we CANT do it by ourselves.<br /><br />Any way, whats done is done, and Gum has his bow, so this thread in my case, is done <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /> situation resolved! have a great day, and please flame me the best you can. I could use a laugh here and there <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /><br /><br />
